["Increases the friendly target's armor by {1} for {2} hour."]="Zvyšuje Armor spojence o {1} na {2} h.",
["Increases the initial damage of your Immolate spell by {1}% and your Conflagrate spell has a {2}% chance to Daze the target, reducing the target's movement speed by {3}% for {4} sec."]="Zvyšuje počáteční poškození tvého kouzla Immolate o {1} % a tvoje kouzlo Conflagrate má {2} % šanci omráčit cíl, čímž sníží rychlost pohybu cíle o {3} % na {4} sekund.",
["Increases the maximum health and Mana of your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, and Felhunter by {1}%, and increases your maximum Mana by {2}%."]="Zvyšuje maximální zdraví a Mana tvých Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus a Felhunter o {1} % a zvyšuje tvoje maximum Mana o {2} %.",
["Increases the range of your damaging spells by {1}%."]="Zvyšuje dosah tvých škodlivých kouzel o {1}%.",
["Increases the threat generated by your Holy Strike ability by {1}%. While Righteous Fury is active, Holy Strike also reduces your damage taken by {2}% for {3} sec."]="Zvyšuje hrozbu generovanou tvé schopností Holy Strike o {1}%. Zatímco je Righteous Fury aktivní, Holy Strike také snižuje tvoje poškození o {2} % po dobu {3} sekund.",
["Increases the threat generated by your Holy Strike ability {1}%. While Righteous Fury is active, Holy Strike also reduces your damage taken by {2}% for {3} sec."]="Zvyšuje ohrožení (threat) generované schopností Holy Strike o {1} %. Když je aktivní Righteous Fury, Holy Strike navíc snižuje tvé přijaté poškození o {2} % na {3} s.",
["Increases your Defense Skill by {1}"]="Zvyšuje Defense Skill o {1}",
["Increases your Parry chance by {1}%."]="Zvyšuje tvou šanci na odražení o {1} %.",
["Increases your Physical and Holy damage dealt by {1}% for {2} sec after landing a non-periodic critical strike. Stacks up to {3} times."]="Po neperiodickém kritickém zásahu zvyšuje tvé fyzické a svaté poškození o {1} % na {2} s. Sčítá se až {3}×.",
["Increases your Strength by {1}%."]="Zvyšuje Strength o {1} %.",
