["Your next Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Summon spell has its casting time reduced by {1} sec and its Mana cost reduced by {2}%."]="Tvoje další kouzlo Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus nebo Felhunter Summon má zkrácenou dobu sesílání o {1} s a cenu Mana sníženou o {2} %.",
